<title>SPAIN: Mapfre Vida posts 14 pct rise in Q1 net. [CORRECTED 15:19 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mapfre Vida posts 14 pct rise in Q1 net. [CORRECTED 15:19 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spain's Mapfre Vida life insurance firm for the first quarter of 1997, in billion pesetas unless stated. (Corrects to make clear results apply to Mapfre Vida group, not Corporacion Mapfre).</p>
<p>GROUP</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		  1.99     up    20 pct</p>
<p> Attributable profit	   1.41     up    14 pct</p>
<p>PARENT COMPANY</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		  1.65     up    29 pct</p>
<p> Net profit			1.12     up    25 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - In a statement the company said its investment trusts totalled 205.7 billion pesetas, up 48 percent, while pension funds were 66 percent higher at 29.17 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
